  "bodyHash": "cf76c0149bbc2498",
  "content": "\n\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/illagerinvasion/banner.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"240\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/illagerinvasion/strip.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"14\"></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center;line-height:36px\"><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252flunapixel.studio%252fdiscord\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/static/v1?label=&message=Discord&color=ECEBE6&labelColor=2F4858&style=for-the-badge&logo=discord&logoColor=white\" width=\"117\" height=\"28\"></a>&emsp;<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fx.com%252fFusseel\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/static/v1?label=&message=Twitter&color=ECEBE6&labelColor=2F4858&style=for-the-badge&logo=x&logoColor=white\" width=\"116\" height=\"28\"></a>&emsp;<a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/@heyitsfuzs\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/static/v1?label=&message=YouTube&color=ECEBE6&labelColor=2F4858&style=for-the-badge&logo=youtube&logoColor=white\" width=\"118\" height=\"28\"></a>&emsp;<a href=\"https://github.com/Fuzss\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/static/v1?label=&message=GitHub&color=ECEBE6&labelColor=2F4858&style=for-the-badge&logo=github&logoColor=white\" width=\"108\" height=\"28\"></a>&emsp;<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/members/fuzs_\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/static/v1?label=&message=CurseForge&color=ECEBE6&labelColor=2F4858&style=for-the-badge&logo=curseforge&logoColor=white\" width=\"143\" height=\"28\"></a>&emsp;<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fuser%252fFuzs\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/static/v1?label=&message=Modrinth&color=ECEBE6&labelColor=2F4858&style=for-the-badge&logo=modrinth&logoColor=white\" width=\"129\" height=\"28\"></a></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/illagerinvasion/strip.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"14\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/commons/headers/about.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"32\"></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">《灾厄入侵》将 Minecraft 中的灾厄村民提升到了全新境界！近十种拥有独特能力的新灾厄村民现已游荡在你的世界中。有些隐藏在危险的全新建筑中，而另一些则加入村庄袭击，使其更加艰难。</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">智斗更聪明的敌人，寻找强力战利品，探索隐秘之地。新的挑战意味着新的奖励&mdash;—以及沿途无尽的乐趣！</span></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/illagerinvasion/strip.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"14\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/commons/headers/features.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"32\"></p>\n<p><strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">🏹 新灾厄村民</span></strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\">🧪 </span><strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">炼金术士</span></strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">：被激怒时会投掷滞留药水的弓箭高手。</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\">📚 </span><strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">书记官</span></strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">：能为附近的灾厄村民施加附魔增益。受惊时会逃跑并施放法术。</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\">🛡️ </span><strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">猛击者</span></strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">：手持盾牌的恶霸，会向玩家发起冲锋。</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\">🪓 </span><strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">掠夺者</span></strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">：远程攻击的灾厄村民，会投掷致命的短斧——从它身上夺取 </span><strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">铂金淬炼斧</span></strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">吧！</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\">🏹 </span><strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">挑衅者</span></strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">：使用弓箭的灾厄村民，掌握基础增益法术。</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\">🔮 </span><strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">术士</span></strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">：诡秘莫测的施法者，能召唤危险的紫色火焰。掉落 </span><strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">奇异尘埃</span></strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">。</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\">🧟 </span><strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">死灵法师</span></strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">：亡灵大师，通过召唤法术淹没玩家。</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\">🛡️ </span><strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">审判官</span></strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">：手持强力盾牌的强大战士——先打破它的盾牌才能击败它！</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\">🔥 </span><strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">唤火者</span></strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">：外表神秘无害的法师——直到他释放出毁灭性的魔法。</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\">🧙 </span><strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">祈唤者</span></strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">：最强大的灾厄村民！掉落 </span><strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">圣化宝石</span></strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">，可用于在 </span><strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">铭刻台</span></strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">上升级附魔。</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\">🎭 </span><strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">幻影师</span></strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">：现已加入生存模式，并拥有全新外观！掉落 </span><strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">幻象尘埃</span></strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">。</span></li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">🏰 新建筑</span></strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\">🏠 </span><strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">唤火者小屋</span></strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">：带有农田的小房子。发现于恶地生物群系。</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\">🏰 </span><strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">灾厄堡垒</span></strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">：设有围墙、高塔和强力灾厄村民的防御前哨。发现于针叶林生物群系。</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\">🗼 </span><strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">幻影师高塔</span></strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">：多层高塔，内部布满灾厄村民，顶层会有幻影师战斗。发现于针叶林和深色森林生物群系。</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\">🧩 </span><strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">迷宫</span></strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">：庞大的地下迷宫，充满丰富战利品和更多灾厄村民。留意石制神庙入口！发现于大多数森林生物群系。</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\">🛖 </span><strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">术士小屋</span></strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">：小型房屋结构。发现于深色森林生物群系。</span></li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">🛠️ 新装备与物品</span></strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\">🔔 </span><strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">铭刻台</span></strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">：突破常规限制升级附魔！每次使用需要消耗一个 </span><strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">圣化宝石</span></strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">。</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\">🪓 </span><strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">铂金淬炼斧</span></strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">：可投掷的斧状武器，由掠夺者罕见掉落。</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\">🕯️ </span><strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">失落蜡烛</span></strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">：通过揭示位置帮助定位附近的矿石。</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\">📯 </span><strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">洞察号角</span></strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">：使附近怪物发光，便于更快发现它们！</span></li>\n</ul>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/illagerinvasion/strip.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"14\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/commons/headers/media.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"32\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/illagerinvasion/media/1.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"480\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/illagerinvasion/media/2.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"480\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/illagerinvasion/media/3.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"480\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/illagerinvasion/media/4.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"480\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/illagerinvasion/media/5.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"480\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/illagerinvasion/strip.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"14\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/commons/headers/installation.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"32\"></p>\n<p><strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">⏩ </span></strong><strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">客户端必须安装 &amp; 服务器必需</span></strong></p>\n<p><strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">⏩ </span></strong><strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">需要安装 </span></strong><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/puzzles-lib\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">PUZZLES LIB</span></strong></a><strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">（适用于 Fabric &amp; NeoForge）</span></strong></p>\n<p><strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">⏩ </span></strong><strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">需要安装 </span></strong><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/fabric-api\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">FABRIC API</span></strong></a><strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">（适用于 Fabric）</span></strong></p>\n<p><strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">⏩ </span></strong><strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">需要安装 </span></strong><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/forge-config-api-port-fabric\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">FORGE CONFIG API PORT</span></strong></a><strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">（适用于 Fabric）</span></strong></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/illagerinvasion/strip.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"14\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/commons/headers/configuration.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"32\"></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">如果模组支持配置，可直接在游戏内通过模组菜单进行设置（Fabric 版需安装由 </span><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fmodmenu\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">Prospector</span></a><span style=\"font-size:14px\"> 开发的 </span><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fmodmenu\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">Mod Menu</span></a><span style=\"font-size:14px\">）。请注意，在较旧的 Minecraft 版本中，还需安装 </span><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/config-menus-forge\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">Forge Config Screens</span></a><span style=\"font-size:14px\">。</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">如需使用外部文本编辑器进行手动配置，所有文件均位于 </span><code><span style=\"font-size:14px\">.minecraft/config</span></code><span style=\"font-size:14px\"> 目录下，文件名分别为 </span><code><span style=\"font-size:14px\">MOD_ID-client.toml</span></code><span style=\"font-size:14px\">、</span><code><span style=\"font-size:14px\">MOD_ID-common.toml</span></code><span style=\"font-size:14px\"> 或 </span><code><span style=\"font-size:14px\">MOD_ID-server.toml</span></code><span style=\"font-size:14px\">，具体取决于配置类型。并非所有类型的配置文件都会存在。</span></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/illagerinvasion/strip.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"14\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/commons/headers/credits.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"32\"></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">🌟 </span><span style=\"font-size:14px\">衷心感谢 </span><a href=\"https://github.com/OhDricky\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">Dricky</span></a><span style=\"font-size:14px\"> 最初创建了出色的《灾厄扩展》模组。《灾厄入侵》忠实延续了其作品，并进行了大量新增内容、改进、重构与漏洞修复。</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">🌟 </span><span style=\"font-size:14px\">感谢 </span><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fuser%252fZekeSmith\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">ZekeSmith</span></a><span style=\"font-size:14px\"> 在 Dricky 删除源码后找到了原始的《灾厄扩展》源代码，使得依据 </span><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fspdx.org%252flicenses%252fMIT.html\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">MIT</span></a><span style=\"font-size:14px\"> 许可证进行移植成为可能。</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">🌟 </span><span style=\"font-size:14px\">感谢 </span><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/members/safrodev\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">safrodev</span></a><span style=\"font-size:14px\"> 对《灾厄扩展》1.19.2 版本的维护工作，“洞察号角”的纹理即取自该版本。</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">🌟 </span><span style=\"font-size:14px\">感谢 </span><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/members/tamlighter\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">Tamlighter</span></a><span style=\"font-size:14px\"> 创作了大量精美的新纹理。</span></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/illagerinvasion/strip.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"14\"></p>\n\n<table style=\"text-align:center\">\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/combat-nouveau\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/combatnouveau/banner.png\" width=\"410\" height=\"115\"></a></td>\n<td>&emsp;&emsp;</td>\n<td><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/cut-through\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/cutthrough/banner.png\" width=\"410\" height=\"115\"></a></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/magnum-torch\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/magnumtorch/banner.png\" width=\"410\" height=\"115\"></a></td>\n<td>&emsp;&emsp;</td>\n<td><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/universal-bone-meal\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/universalbonemeal/banner.png\" width=\"410\" height=\"115\"></a></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/easy-anvils\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/easyanvils/banner.png\" width=\"410\" height=\"115\"></a></td>\n<td>&emsp;&emsp;</td>\n<td><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/eternal-nether\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/eternalnether/banner.png\" width=\"410\" height=\"115\"></a></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/straw-statues\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/strawstatues/banner.png\" width=\"410\" height=\"115\"></a></td>\n<td>&emsp;&emsp;</td>\n<td><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/ender-zoology\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/enderzoology/banner.png\" width=\"410\" height=\"115\"></a></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/horse-expert\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/horseexpert/banner.png\" width=\"410\" height=\"115\"></a></td>\n<td>&emsp;&emsp;</td>\n<td><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/linked-chests\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/linkedchests/banner.png\" width=\"410\" height=\"115\"></a></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/illagerinvasion/strip.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"14\"></p>\n<p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252flunapixel.studio%252fdiscord\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/commons/studio.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"240\"></a></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/illagerinvasion/strip.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"14\"></p>",
